ONE STEP REMAINING BEFORE PUBLISHING
====================================================================
GPL v3 requires the FULL LICENCE TEXT to be distributed with the work.
A notice alone is not sufficient. Replace everything below this line
with the text from:

    https://www.gnu.org/licenses/gpl-3.0.txt

From a terminal, in the repository root:

    curl -o LICENSE.gpl https://www.gnu.org/licenses/gpl-3.0.txt
    cat LICENSE.gpl >> LICENSE && rm LICENSE.gpl

Or simply download that file and paste its contents here, removing
this instruction block.

